{
  "crew": "prime-meridian",
  "workspace": "crew",
  "panesPerTab": 2,
  "tabPrefix": "crew",
  "machine": null,
  "cwd": null,
  "checkout": "shared",
  "naming": "French names, after Claude Monet (crew-up's manager); here the manager is Hal, the player's twin. Grammatical gender = where the model runs: masculine = cloud (le-/un-, Monsieur/M.), feminine = local (la-/une-, Madame/Mme); un-/une- before a vowel, since l' would hide which. m- (M., Monsieur) = a member on a remote open-weight cluster. Jobs: architecte (architect), automate (builder; one per area, e.g. un-automate-monde, une-automate-arbres), testeur (tester), coureur (runner), critique (critic), docteur (docs: 'doc', and M.D. = Markdown; the docs are the crew's memory). Herdr names: a-z 0-9 - _, at most 32 characters.",
  "backends": {
    "anthropic": {
      "enabled": true,
      "settings": null,
      "note": "stock Claude Code login (claude.ai subscription)"
    },
    "local": {
      "enabled": false,
      "settings": "~/.config/crew-up/settings.local.json",
      "note": "Anthropic-compatible local server; members on it are la-/une-"
    }
  },
  "members": [
